<!-- Hand-written for epiphany-musicxml's tests. Beams in 2/4: two beamed
     pairs of eighths, the second over a chord whose second note repeats the
     beam; four sixteenths with their second beam; a dotted eighth and a
     sixteenth with a backward hook; a second voice's eighths beamed apart
     from the first's; and a beam begun and never ended. -->
